evaluated_prompts.instruction:
Provide a compact, self‑contained answer that:
• states the pivotal insight in one brief sentence;
• performs only the indispensable computation (show a step only if it aids understanding);
• optionally adds a one‑sentence verification;
• concludes with the exact result—integer, reduced fraction, decimal, or simplest radical—on a single line by itself, with no surrounding characters or formatting.

Write a compact, self‑contained response in plain text that:
– states the key idea in one short sentence;
– carries out only the indispensable computation, showing intermediate steps only when they aid understanding;
– optionally adds a brief sanity check;
– places the final answer—integer, reduced fraction, decimal, or simplest radical—on the very last line, alone, with no surrounding symbols or extra spaces.
